  "coexistence": "The coexistence of humans and AIs in a future society will likely hinge on the moral principles delineating our responsibilities towards these technologically advanced entities. As we continue to integrate AI into various aspects of our lives, it becomes imperative to establish a clear moral framework informed by human dignity and values that guides how we interact with, develop, and govern AI.",
