  "thoughtThree": "Considering consciousness and sentience, one philosophical question is whether AI could be or be evolved to be capable of experiencing emotion and understanding in ways similar to humans, or if that belongs exclusively to biological life, such debates could critically influence how we regard AI coexistence and further development."
